     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
     "lines": "270-279"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The sequencer's register table lists the Address register and five data registers, indexed 00 to 04: Reset, Clocking Mode, Map Mask, Character Map Select and Memory Mode.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2800-2806",
       "sha": "3b402f4dc00d712a0370bb140121b36cd6202f33b3ded9d9edfe89438cdd5628"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2807-2813",
       "sha": "fd085254ba6ab4f7fb3bf91b8ac98fcc3bc993554c2e1e1b2ae902a6b3e61c25"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The Address register at hex 03C4 is loaded with an index value that points to the desired sequencer data register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2814-2817",
       "sha": "31b515f9e0daaa9e5ae450270ab55cd67aa0297d4cf2bc932670d9d542482b94"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The Sequencer Address field, bits 2-0, holds the index; a write sets the other bits to 0, which read as undefined (the capture prints 8 for 0).",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2820",
       "sha": "f7686ad9dee5b48d3ffd8e70d60664bba6eb04f5236811ed670f77894f384f98"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2824-2825",
       "sha": "3571e2042406e0b2bff572b3eb155e690bf266c007b382503342ed24ed0ab924"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "102",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "text": "A write masks the index to 4 bits (6 on S3, 3 on Tseng) and stores the masked value, which reads back, where the document sets bits 7-3 to 0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
       "lines": "70-78",
       "sha": "fa42bf4e129d3a11788160963408be89d58c82d72dfadf9d9bc971629b71622a"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
       "lines": "82-84",
       "sha": "7a010172bcb3854c694f4dd98743dcf800a33d6671262b958490b863fa26ba78"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
       "lines": "34",
       "sha": "ef43bf3b6f5d43de577c1c0d3fcec6a4ffa843474c9cab774de1e337e0447ed3"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
       "lines": "86",
       "sha": "7f4d8af54a373869c53a276016afd293faa677a09ce5f9cb405b94cca49fd1c4"
      }
     ],
     "row": "3"
    },
    {
