  {
   "key": "0x02",
   "name": "map mask",
   "aliases": [
    "sequencer map mask"
   ],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
     "lines": "2903-2930"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
     "function": "write_p3c5",
     "case": [
      "2"
     ]
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
     "function": "read_p3c5",
     "case": [
      "2"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Index hex 02 is the read/write Map Mask register at address hex 03C5.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2903-2905",
       "sha": "4dc230ab582b667f37a449053706330bad72b500aff9b5761bf94a9dc925b421"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A write stores M0E-M3E in bits 0-3: 1 enables system access to that map; with all maps enabled the system can write its byte to all four at once.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2915-2921",
       "sha": "25cb2f9dfa998197267a2eaae0d020bc0aed1017ae7e18e9ebdcf045a43cd87e"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "With all maps enabled and the address written with the data held in the system data latches, data scrolling is a read-modify-write operation.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2922-2925",
       "sha": "ceb2506a0537d1ceda662c5abec95b801277fcbe6f72227f4186bec2580d82d8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In odd/even modes, maps 0 and 1 and maps 2 and 3 should have the same map mask value.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2926-2928",
       "sha": "e4116ad8feda0012c83aa658a48b3aee6fcf6190a7ffc467c1922b04dbd5617c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "When chain 4 mode is selected, all maps should be enabled.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2929-2930",
       "sha": "4239de7a2f4817b82685b91e782c14c0f29ac84671a34d1e40f5d9020589b442"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "When a plane is masked off in chained mode, a change reconfigures the memory handlers.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_seq.cpp",
       "lines": "180-181",
       "sha": "69e65ce3a29fcb194aed4fa3866db3abe95322e66db7249f0887db8d2cb9e13c"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
